<dispatchitem code="00008597.0003001" func-code="79-07-02" item-list-nbr="02" revdate="2019-05-22T00:00:00"><title>Oil Pressure Indication and Advisory on the <tech-label type="s-page">ENGINE</tech-label></title><functional-notes><note code="00008597.0003001.003" layer="1" lid="N.00008597.0003001.003"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008597.0003001.004">Simultaneous illumination
of the <tech-label type="pb-sw">BLUE ELEC PUMP</tech-label> <tech-label type="light">FAULT</tech-label> and the <tech-label type="pb-sw">ENG 1(2) PUMP</tech-label> <tech-label type="light">FAULT</tech-label> with engines off may be
due to a failed engine oil low pressure switch. In this case, the <ecam-data ecamimportance="R" type="alert"><ecamsys>ENG 1(2)</ecamsys><ecamtitle>OIL LO PR</ecamtitle></ecam-data> alert is inoperative
and the dispatch is not permitted.</para></note></functional-notes><ditembody nb-installed="2"><dispcond code="00008597.0003001.004" dispcond-id="D06917" dispcond-label="C" lid="N.00008597.0003001.006"><normal-dispcond nb-required="1" rectification-interval="C"><remark><requirementblock><requirement lid="N.00008597.0003001.007" req-id="R06918"><qualifiers><qualifier value="ETOPS"/><qualifier value="NOGO_IF_79-09-01"/><qualifier value="NOGO_IF_77-07-02-09"/></qualifiers><para code="00008597.0003001.005" layer="1" lid="N.00008597.0003001.008">One may be inoperative provided that:</para></requirement><addrequ lid="N.00008597.0003001.009"><requirement lid="N.00008597.0003001.010" req-id="R06919"><para code="00008597.0003001.006" layer="1" lid="N.00008597.0003001.011"><abb>ETOPS</abb> is not conducted, and</para></requirement></addrequ><addrequ lid="N.00008597.0003001.012"><requirement lid="N.00008597.0003001.013" req-id="R06920"><para code="00008597.0003001.007" layer="1" lid="N.00008597.0003001.014">The associated <ecam-data ecamimportance="R" type="alert"><ecamsys>ENG 1(2)</ecamsys><ecamtitle>OIL LO PR</ecamtitle></ecam-data> alert is operative, and</para></requirement></addrequ><addrequ lid="N.00008597.0003001.015"><requirement lid="N.00008597.0003001.016" req-id="R06921"><para code="00008597.0003001.008" layer="1" lid="N.00008597.0003001.017">The associated oil quantity indication is operative on the <tech-label type="s-page">ENGINE</tech-label>.</para></requirement></addrequ></requirementblock></remark></normal-dispcond></dispcond></ditembody></dispatchitem>